Title: Count Missing Values by Group
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Qilin", "Song", , "sq10629@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a function to summarize missing values by group.
    Given a data frame or tibble and a grouping column, the function
    returns one row per group and the number of missing values in
    each remaining column.
